Local modifications: optional snapshotBlur caching, input/editable-content exclusion in snapshot capture,
animateSpecular:false to retain highlights without continuous idle redraw,
per-lens opacity to follow foreground panel transitions, embedded document SVG symbols and
paint-state-aware SVG caching, bilinear clear-glass sampling without the extra five-tap blur,
scene-only bootstrap, cached GPU capability probes, bounded same-origin native-view snapshots,
fixed-anchor / visual-viewport alignment, bounded local optical render targets,
a stable specular light phase for non-animated lenses, and optional text-free
backdrop snapshots to prevent fixed-label ghosts while scrolling, scoped navigation-ink
snapshots with scene-isolated stacking, and ancestor exclusions relative to the snapshot root.

Visual assets:
- c2000max-front.png: existing C2000MAX prototype asset derived from user-supplied references.
- reference-art.png: user-supplied page artwork reused by the prototype.
- china-mobile.png: China Mobile mark; see its adjacent source note. Trademark rights remain with the owner.
- Bundled fallback wallpaper: wallpaper/default.jpg; source and original credit are recorded in wallpaper/default.json.
- Daily Bing wallpaper: fetched at runtime. The original copyright credit is displayed on the login page.

